+//! Selected direct `ZoneSpaceHeatBalanceData::correctHumRat` owner.
+//!
+//! The caller supplies the selected four-slot working history. Current/average
+//! humidity, all histories and temperature fields are retained by this member.
+//! Ordinary correction/history/HVAC integration is deliberately not activated.
